"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Weitere Informationen "
"[hier](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-"
"L2VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products)."

